 "func_desc_layout": "full",
 "func_desc": [
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "4.1 Scenarios (skenario_h0253.xlsx, part 52119BZV60, order ID1H4571, qty 8)"
  },
  {
   "type": "table",
   "level": 0,
   "row_lines": "all",
   "columns": [
    {
     "title": "Scenario",
     "width": 10
    },
    {
     "title": "H0253 14-Oct -> 15-Oct",
     "width": 18
    },
    {
     "title": "NSP (XD08 / XD12 / XD11)",
     "width": 24
    }
   ],
   "rows": [
    [
     "1 Normal",
     "Status 7 qty 8 -> same row status 6 qty 8",
     "XD08 updates the row (received). No cancel, XD11 not involved."
    ],
    [
     "2 Partial cancel",
     "Status 7 qty 8 -> serial A status 7 qty 6 + serial B status 2 qty 2",
     "XD12 updates A, inserts B ('P'). XD11: CANCEL 2, VALID 6; not in ASN -> CANCELLED; open mapping released, 6 pcs mapped again by XD09."
    ],
    [
     "3 Full cancel",
     "Status 7 qty 8 -> same row status 2 qty 8",
     "XD12 updates the row ('P'). XD11: CANCEL 8, VALID 0; not in ASN -> CANCELLED; open mapping released."
    ],
    [
     "4 Abnormality",
     "8 pcs already in a submitted ASN, then cancel (SOP not followed)",
     "XD11: QTY_IN_ASN 8 > VALID_QTY -> CONFLICT; ASN not changed; D/S handles the case at receiving."
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "4.2 Rules"
  },
  {
   "type": "bullets",
   "marker": "-",
   "level": 0,
   "items": [
    "NSP never cancels a customer order and has no Cancel ASN. A line can be cancelled with or without hold; HOLD_FLAG is only recorded.",
    "The calculation is per line (all SERIAL_NO), because G-TOPAS splits a partially cancelled line into a new serial.",
    "Prevention of a cancel of qty in an ASN: existing ASN feedback to G-TOPAS + SOP of the D/S team. XD11 only detects the abnormality (CONFLICT).",
    "CONFLICT: the D/S team handles the shipped case at receiving in G-TOPAS: allocate it to an open order (same or another destination), otherwise move it to warehouse stock (prototype menu Cancel Order Simulation).",
    "The exception list of the D/S team is the Log (Log Monitoring, LOG4); TB_R_CROSSDOCK_CANCEL_RESULT keeps the result per row. No separate screen (decided 19-Oct).",
    "The released PO qty of a CONFLICT is not blocked (decided 19-Oct); it is taken by the next orders in XD09."
   ]
  }
 ],
